薛城（今山东滕州东南），号孟尝君，以广招宾客、食客三千闻名。","link_td_id":"Q10001044","link_td_number_id":205703,"people_name":"孟嘗君","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟尝君","people_xingming":"孟尝君","start_index":169,"tongjian_id":"8c8898b6-db0e-11ef-8e71-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","resolved_place_entity_id":25,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c8898aa-db0e-11ef-b62d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ab-db0e-11ef-9c78-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c8898b1-db0e-11ef-b11e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"8c8898b4-db0e-11ef-b949-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["权争","外交"],"content":"1或謂秦王曰：「孟嘗君相秦，必先齊而後秦；秦其危哉！」秦王乃以樓緩爲相，囚孟嘗君，欲殺之。孟嘗君使人求解於秦王幸姬，姬曰：「願得君狐白裘。」孟嘗君有狐白裘，已獻之秦王，無以應姬求。客有善爲狗盜者，入秦藏中，盜狐白裘以獻姬。姬乃爲之言於王而遣之。王後悔，使追之。孟嘗君至關，關法，雞鳴而出客，時尚蚤，追者將至，客有善爲雞鳴者，野雞聞之皆鳴，孟嘗君乃得脫歸。","content_fanyi":"有人对秦王说：“孟尝君在秦国为相，必定先考虑齐国，然后才考虑秦国；秦国恐怕危险了！”秦王于是任命楼缓为相，把孟尝君囚禁起来，想杀掉他。孟尝君派人向秦王宠爱的姬妾求救，姬妾说：“我希望得到您的白狐皮袍。”孟尝君本来有一件白狐皮袍，已经献给秦王，没有办法满足她的要求。门客中有个擅长偷盗的人，潜入秦国的库房，把白狐皮袍偷出来献给姬妾。姬妾于是替他在秦王面前说情，秦王便放他回国。后来秦王后悔了，派人追赶他。孟尝君到了边关，按照关规，鸡叫以后才能放人出关，当时天色还早，追赶的人快要到了，门客中有个擅长学鸡叫的人，他一叫，野鸡听到后都跟着叫了起来，孟尝君这才得以脱身回国。","content_jianti_auto":"1或谓秦王曰：「孟尝君相秦，必先齐而后秦；秦其危哉！」秦王乃以楼缓为相，囚孟尝君，欲杀之。孟尝君使人求解于秦王幸姬，姬曰：「愿得君狐白裘。」孟尝君有狐白裘，已献之秦王，无以应姬求。客有善为狗盗者，入秦藏中，盗狐白裘以献姬。姬乃为之言于王而遣之。王后悔，使追之。孟尝君至关，关法，鸡鸣而出客，时尚蚤，追者将至，客有善为鸡鸣者，野鸡闻之皆鸣，孟尝君乃得脱归。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":297,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c8898a2-db0e-11ef-9b33-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否因楚国宣告新王而发兵攻楚","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_8C8898B7DB0E11EF93AAA0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-325,"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"秦昭襄王，嬴姓，名稷，秦惠文王之子，秦悼武王之弟，战国时期秦国君主。","link_td_id":"Q10001807","link_td_number_id":176297,"people_name":"秦王","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦王","people_xingming":"嬴稷","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c8898b8-db0e-11ef-9632-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[嬴稷]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":130,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c8898b9-db0e-11ef-8aac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ba-db0e-11ef-b5e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武關","place_name_jianti_auto":"武关","place_note":"陕西丹凤东南","resolved_place_entity_id":840,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c8898bb-db0e-11ef-83a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":130,"start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8c8898bc-db0e-11ef-9e54-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/魏冉罪大","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。是时，王不过十余岁，为此者必冉也。后冉为范睢所间而废逐...","context_before":"...王少，太后自治事，任冉为政，威震秦国，才六年而诈留楚王，","source_end_index":254,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f578d577-8b7e-4fd8-b354-3e0b6bbeee5d","source_start_index":242,"source_text":"又怒其立太子，复取十六城"}],"path":"四笔/卷九/魏冉罪大","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉仍曰析县。晋因之。后魏置析阳郡，领东西二析阳县，此即西...","context_before":"...，秦、晋伐鄀，过析，即此。又昭十八年，许迁于析，实白羽。","source_end_index":81,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cfc0aa3c-0abc-59ac-a1f3-b222eff812de","source_start_index":59,"source_text":"战国时，秦昭王发兵出武关，攻楚，取析，是也。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"及秦并六国，东至齐，即墨大夫入见齐王曰：使鄢郢大夫收楚地...","context_before":"...强百万也。三十年，秦昭王绐怀王会武关，至则闭，执之以归。","source_end_index":429,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e50d3daf-9bb4-555a-838d-7253c4f724ea","source_start_index":410,"source_text":"顷襄王元年，秦出武关攻楚，取析十五城。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、郧阳府（卷七十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"顷襄王十九年，割上庸、汉北地与秦。割上庸之明年，秦拔西陵...","context_before":"...蔽。春秋时，楚人灭庸。识者谓楚灭庸而秦从师，自楚庄时始。","source_end_index":74,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ecb1fa86-eeda-5da3-bc94-510a226160a1","source_start_index":55,"source_text":"异时秦拔武关，取上庸，即今日之故道也。"}],"path":"湖广方舆纪要/九、郧阳府（卷七十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"2楚人告于秦曰：「賴社稷神靈，國有王矣！」秦王怒，發兵出武關擊楚，斬首五萬，取十六城。","content_fanyi":"楚国人向秦国通报说：“仰赖社稷神灵保佑，楚国已经有君王了！”秦王大怒，发兵出武关攻打楚国，斩首五万，夺取十六座城邑。","content_jianti_auto":"2楚人告于秦曰：「赖社稷神灵，国有王矣！」秦王怒，发兵出武关击楚，斩首五万，取十六城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":298,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c8898b7-db0e-11ef-93aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c0-db0e-11ef-95b0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「弟」下有「勝」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「弟」下有「胜」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c8898bf-db0e-11ef-89ad-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c8898be-db0e-11ef-9c4f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c2-db0e-11ef-ba9f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"胜","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c3-db0e-11ef-a532-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"平原君","people_name_jianti_auto":"平原君","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c4-db0e-11ef-aeb5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c5-db0e-11ef-853a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"平原縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"平原县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c6-db0e-11ef-8cc7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平原郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"平原郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c7-db0e-11ef-a1ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東武城","place_name_jianti_auto":"东武城","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c8-db0e-11ef-ae4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平原","place_name_jianti_auto":"平原","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c9-db0e-11ef-a597-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東武城","place_name_jianti_auto":"东武城","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ca-db0e-11ef-841c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清河郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"清河郡","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8c8898cb-db0e-11ef-8d07-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"貝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"贝州","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c8898cc-db0e-11ef-b0d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"武城县","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c8898cd-db0e-11ef-9533-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"定襄","place_name_jianti_auto":"定襄","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ce-db0e-11ef-a791-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武城","place_name_jianti_auto":"武城","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8c8898cf-db0e-11ef-92ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c8898d0-db0e-11ef-a103-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志，平原縣屬平原郡。勝封於東武城，號平原君，非封於平原也。東武城屬清河郡，杜佑曰：今貝州武城縣是也。蓋定襄有武城，時同屬趙，故此加「東」也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志，平原县属平原郡。胜封于东武城，号平原君，非封于平原也。东武城属清河郡，杜佑曰：今贝州武城县是也。盖定襄有武城，时同属赵，故此加「东」也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c8898c1-db0e-11ef-9927-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c8898d5-db0e-11ef-941d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「嘗」作「常」；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「尝」作「常」；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c8898d4-db0e-11ef-879b-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c8898d3-db0e-11ef-bec1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"成玄英","people_name_jianti_auto":"成玄英","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c8898d7-db0e-11ef-b47e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"公孫龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙龙","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c8898d8-db0e-11ef-bc1b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"墨子","people_name_jianti_auto":"墨子","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"8c8898d9-db0e-11ef-bdb5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"公孫龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙龙","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8c8898da-db0e-11ef-baf1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汝南","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝南","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"8c8898db-db0e-11ef-a572-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西平縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"西平县","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"8c8898dc-db0e-11ef-b067-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍淵","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙渊","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"8c8898dd-db0e-11ef-a30f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢書·藝文志：公孫龍子十四篇。註云：卽爲堅白同異之辯者。成玄英莊子疏云：公孫龍著守白論，行於世。堅白，卽守白也，言堅執其說，如墨子墨守之義。自堅白之論起，辯者互執是非，不勝異說。公孫龍能合衆異而爲同，故謂之同異。史記註曰：晉太康地記云：汝南西平縣有龍淵，水可用淬刀劍，極堅利，故有堅白之論云：黃，所以爲堅也；白，所以爲利也。或曰：黃所以爲不堅，白所以爲不利。二說未知孰是。勝，音升。淬，取內翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉书·艺文志：公孙龙子十四篇。注云：即为坚白同异之辩者。成玄英庄子疏云：公孙龙著守白论，行于世。坚白，即守白也，言坚执其说，如墨子墨守之义。自坚白之论起，辩者互执是非，不胜异说。公孙龙能合众异而为同，故谓之同异。史记注曰：晋太康地记云：汝南西平县有龙渊，水可用淬刀剑，极坚利，故有坚白之论云：黄，所以为坚也；白，所以为利也。或曰：黄所以为不坚，白所以为不利。二说未知孰是。胜，音升。淬，取内翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8c8898d6-db0e-11ef-85f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孔穿","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔穿","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c8898e6-db0e-11ef-beca-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c8898e7-db0e-11ef-9b0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孫愐","people_name_jianti_auto":"孙愐","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c8898e8-db0e-11ef-abbd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8c8898e9-db0e-11ef-a555-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"殷湯","people_name_jianti_auto":"殷汤","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ea-db0e-11ef-893f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"帝嚳","people_name_jianti_auto":"帝喾","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8c8898eb-db0e-11ef-8670-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"簡狄","people_name_jianti_auto":"简狄","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ec-db0e-11ef-ab94-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"契","people_name_jianti_auto":"契","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ed-db0e-11ef-ac00-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"湯","people_name_jianti_auto":"汤","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ee-db0e-11ef-bb12-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"履","people_name_jianti_auto":"履","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ef-db0e-11ef-b043-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"天乙","people_name_jianti_auto":"天乙","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f0-db0e-11ef-a5ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔氏","start_index":77,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f1-db0e-11ef-b21c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔父","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔父","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f2-db0e-11ef-a405-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"華督","people_name_jianti_auto":"华督","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f3-db0e-11ef-ada9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f4-db0e-11ef-9a78-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f5-db0e-11ef-9d7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f6-db0e-11ef-82f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f7-db0e-11ef-8884-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按孔叢子，孔穿，孔子之後。孫愐曰：孔姓，殷湯之後，本自帝嚳元妃簡狄，吞乙卵生契，賜姓子氏；至湯，以其祖感乙而生，故名履，字天乙；後代以「子」加「乙」，始爲孔氏。至宋孔父遭華督之難，其子奔魯，故孔子生於魯。愐，彌兗翻。嚳，苦沃翻。華，戶化翻。難，乃旦翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按孔丛子，孔穿，孔子之后。孙愐曰：孔姓，殷汤之后，本自帝喾元妃简狄，吞乙卵生契，赐姓子氏；至汤，以其祖感乙而生，故名履，字天乙；后代以「子」加「乙」，始为孔氏。至宋孔父遭华督之难，其子奔鲁，故孔子生于鲁。愐，弥兖翻。喾，苦沃翻。华，户化翻。难，乃旦翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8c8898e5-db0e-11ef-a1df-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"三耳，如莊子所載雞三足之說。莊子疏謂數起於一，一與一爲二，二與一爲三，三名雖立，實無定體，故雞可以爲三足，則兩耳、三耳，其說亦猶是耳。一說：耳主聽，兩耳，形也，兼聽而言，可得爲三。臧，臧獲之臧。臧獲，奴婢也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"三耳，如庄子所载鸡三足之说。庄子疏谓数起于一，一与一为二，二与一为三，三名虽立，实无定体，故鸡可以为三足，则两耳、三耳，其说亦犹是耳。一说：耳主听，两耳，形也，兼听而言，可得为三。臧，臧获之臧。臧获，奴婢也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c8898f9-db0e-11ef-bbbe-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"辯，別也；析，分也；言分別甚精微也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"辩，别也；析，分也；言分别甚精微也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"8c8898fc-db0e-11ef-a203-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"子高","people_name_jianti_auto":"子高","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c8898fe-db0e-11ef-851f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔穿","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔穿","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c8898ff-db0e-11ef-93c0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"子高，孔穿字也。復，扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"子高，孔穿字也。复，扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8c8898fd-db0e-11ef-90e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛晃","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛晃","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c889901-db0e-11ef-af0a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"毛晃曰：疇，曩也；昔，夕也；疇昔，曩夕也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"毛晃曰：畴，曩也；昔，夕也；畴昔，曩夕也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8c889900-db0e-11ef-a930-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛晃","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛晃","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c889903-db0e-11ef-815c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"毛晃曰：然，如也，是也，語決辭。幾，居依翻。令，使也，音力丁翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"毛晃曰：然，如也，是也，语决辞。几，居依翻。令，使也，音力丁翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"8c889902-db0e-11ef-b450-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-310,"link_death_year":-266,"link_td_description":"赵惠文王，亦称文王。名何，赵武灵王次子，周朝战国时期赵国君主。在位时有蔺相如、廉颇、李牧、赵奢等文武大臣，政治清明，武力强大。","link_td_id":"Q10000661","link_td_number_id":334704,"people_name":"趙王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵王","people_xingming":"赵何","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c889905-db0e-11ef-8f08-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[赵何]"},{"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"平原君，嬴姓，赵氏，名胜，赵武灵王之子，赵惠文王的弟弟，母不详，是东周战国时期赵国宗室大臣，在赵惠文王和赵孝成王时任宰相，是著名的政治家之一，以善于养士而闻名。和齐国孟尝君田文、魏国信陵君魏无忌、楚国春申君黄歇合称战国四公子。","link_td_id":"Q10005454","link_td_number_id":13307,"people_name":"平原君","people_name_jianti_auto":"平原君","people_xingming":"赵胜","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c889906-db0e-11ef-a0a3-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[赵胜]"},{"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"平原君，嬴姓，赵氏，名胜，赵武灵王之子，赵惠文王的弟弟，母不详，是东周战国时期赵国宗室大臣，在赵惠文王和赵孝成王时任宰相，是著名的政治家之一，以善于养士而闻名。和齐国孟尝君田文、魏国信陵君魏无忌、楚国春申君黄歇合称战国四公子。","link_td_id":"Q10005454","link_td_number_id":13307,"people_name":"平原君","people_name_jianti_auto":"平原君","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c889907-db0e-11ef-a576-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[赵胜]"},{"link_birth_year":-320,"link_death_year":-250,"link_td_description":"公孙龙，东周战国时期赵国人（今河北邯郸），传说字子秉，曾经做过平原君的门客，是名家的代表人物，以“白马非马”和“离坚白”等论点而著名。","link_td_id":"Q10000793","link_td_number_id":92102,"people_name":"公孫龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙龙","people_xingming":"公孙龙","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c889908-db0e-11ef-902b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"平原君，嬴姓，赵氏，名胜，赵武灵王之子，赵惠文王的弟弟，母不详，是东周战国时期赵国宗室大臣，在赵惠文王和赵孝成王时任宰相，是著名的政治家之一，以善于养士而闻名。和齐国孟尝君田文、魏国信陵君魏无忌、楚国春申君黄歇合称战国四公子。","link_td_id":"Q10005454","link_td_number_id":13307,"people_name":"平原君","people_name_jianti_auto":"平原君","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8c889909-db0e-11ef-8f05-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[赵胜]"},{"link_td_description":"孔穿，字子高，中国战国时期鲁国人，孔箕之子，孔子之六代孙。生卒时间不详，去世时51岁。曾受楚国、赵国等国礼聘任職，但都被婉拒。记载他曾和公孙龙辩论过白马非马的问题。其子孔谦，孙孔鲋、孔腾、孔树。","link_td_id":"Q10008961","link_td_number_id":466943,"people_name":"孔穿","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔穿","people_xingming":"孔穿","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c88990a-db0e-11ef-ad57-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-320,"link_death_year":-250,"link_td_description":"公孙龙，东周战国时期赵国人（今河北邯郸），传说字子秉，曾经做过平原君的门客，是名家的代表人物，以“白马非马”和“离坚白”等论点而著名。","link_td_id":"Q10000793","link_td_number_id":92102,"people_name":"公孫龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙龙","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c88990d-db0e-11ef-a5af-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-320,"link_death_year":-250,"link_td_description":"公孙龙，东周战国时期赵国人（今河北邯郸），传说字子秉，曾经做过平原君的门客，是名家的代表人物，以“白马非马”和“离坚白”等论点而著名。","link_td_id":"Q10000793","link_td_number_id":92102,"people_name":"龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"龙","people_xingming":"公孙龙","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c88990e-db0e-11ef-8299-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"孔穿，字子高，中国战国时期鲁国人，孔箕之子，孔子之六代孙。生卒时间不详，去世时51岁。曾受楚国、赵国等国礼聘任職，但都被婉拒。记载他曾和公孙龙辩论过白马非马的问题。其子孔谦，孙孔鲋、孔腾、孔树。","link_td_id":"Q10008961","link_td_number_id":466943,"people_name":"子高","people_name_jianti_auto":"子高","people_xingming":"孔穿","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"8c88990f-db0e-11ef-9e5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"平原君，嬴姓，赵氏，名胜，赵武灵王之子，赵惠文王的弟弟，母不详，是东周战国时期赵国宗室大臣，在赵惠文王和赵孝成王时任宰相，是著名的政治家之一，以善于养士而闻名。和齐国孟尝君田文、魏国信陵君魏无忌、楚国春申君黄歇合称战国四公子。","link_td_id":"Q10005454","link_td_number_id":13307,"people_name":"平原君","people_name_jianti_auto":"平原君","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8c889910-db0e-11ef-b76f-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[赵胜]"},{"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"平原君，嬴姓，赵氏，名胜，赵武灵王之子，赵惠文王的弟弟，母不详，是东周战国时期赵国宗室大臣，在赵惠文王和赵孝成王时任宰相，是著名的政治家之一，以善于养士而闻名。和齐国孟尝君田文、魏国信陵君魏无忌、楚国春申君黄歇合称战国四公子。","link_td_id":"Q10005454","link_td_number_id":13307,"people_name":"平原君","people_name_jianti_auto":"平原君","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8c889911-db0e-11ef-b93d-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[赵胜]"},{"link_birth_year":-320,"link_death_year":-250,"link_td_description":"公孙龙，东周战国时期赵国人（今河北邯郸），传说字子秉，曾经做过平原君的门客，是名家的代表人物，以“白马非马”和“离坚白”等论点而著名。","link_td_id":"Q10000793","link_td_number_id":92102,"people_name":"公孫","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙","people_xingming":"公孙龙","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8c889912-db0e-11ef-95af-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"平原君，嬴姓，赵氏，名胜，赵武灵王之子，赵惠文王的弟弟，母不详，是东周战国时期赵国宗室大臣，在赵惠文王和赵孝成王时任宰相，是著名的政治家之一，以善于养士而闻名。和齐国孟尝君田文、魏国信陵君魏无忌、楚国春申君黄歇合称战国四公子。","link_td_id":"Q10005454","link_td_number_id":13307,"people_name":"平原君","people_name_jianti_auto":"平原君","start_index":178,"tongjian_id":"8c889913-db0e-11ef-9dec-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[赵胜]"},{"link_birth_year":-320,"link_death_year":-250,"link_td_description":"公孙龙，东周战国时期赵国人（今河北邯郸），传说字子秉，曾经做过平原君的门客，是名家的代表人物，以“白马非马”和“离坚白”等论点而著名。","link_td_id":"Q10000793","link_td_number_id":92102,"people_name":"公孫龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙龙","start_index":189,"tongjian_id":"8c889914-db0e-11ef-96d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"孔穿，字子高，中国战国时期鲁国人，孔箕之子，孔子之六代孙。生卒时间不详，去世时51岁。曾受楚国、赵国等国礼聘任職，但都被婉拒。记载他曾和公孙龙辩论过白马非马的问题。其子孔谦，孙孔鲋、孔腾、孔树。","link_td_id":"Q10008961","link_td_number_id":466943,"people_name":"孔子高","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子高","people_xingming":"孔穿","start_index":199,"tongjian_id":"8c889915-db0e-11ef-8bdf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","resolved_place_entity_id":506,"start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"8c88990b-db0e-11ef-beff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c88990c-db0e-11ef-a90b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"秦始皇十四年，桓齮伐赵，取武城。汉置东武城县，文帝封齐悼...","context_before":"...东武城故城[在县西。战国时赵邑。赵惠文王封孟尝君以武城。","source_end_index":47,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2c68bea4-4ebd-5b40-b5c7-f58d8578a80c","source_start_index":29,"source_text":"又孝成王封其弟胜于武城，号为平原君。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3趙王封其弟爲平原君。平原君好士，食客嘗數千人。有公孫龍者，善爲堅白同異之辯，平原君客之。孔穿自魯適趙，與公孫龍論臧三耳，龍甚辯析。子高弗應，俄而辭出，明日復見平原君。平原君曰：「疇昔公孫之言信辯也，先生以爲何如？」對曰：「然。幾能令臧三耳矣。雖然，實難！僕願得又問於君：今謂三耳甚難而實非也，謂兩耳甚易而實是也，不知君將從易而是者乎，其亦從難而非者乎？」平原君無以應。明日，謂公孫龍曰：「公無復與孔子高辯事也！其人理勝於辭；公辭勝於理，終必受詘。」","content_fanyi":"赵王封他的弟弟赵胜为平原君。平原君喜爱士人，门下食客曾多达数千人。有个叫公孙龙的人，善于进行“坚白同异”的辩论，平原君以宾客之礼对待他。孔穿，字子高，从鲁国来到赵国，与公孙龙辩论奴仆有三只耳朵的“臧三耳”，公孙龙对此辩析得十分精妙。子高没有回应，不一会儿就告辞退出，第二天又去见平原君。平原君说：“昨天公孙龙那番话确实雄辩，先生认为怎么样？”孔穿回答说：“是的。他几乎能让奴仆有三只耳朵了。虽然如此，实际上很难！我想再向您请教：现在主张奴仆有三只耳朵，非常困难而实际上不是事实；主张奴仆有两只耳朵，非常容易而实际上是事实。不知您将遵从容易而正确的看法，还是遵从困难而不正确的看法呢？”平原君无言以对。第二天，平原君对公孙龙说：“您不要再和子高先生争辩事情了！他是道理胜过言辞；您是言辞胜过道理，最终必定会理屈辞穷。”","content_jianti_auto":"3赵王封其弟为平原君。平原君好士，食客尝数千人。有公孙龙者，善为坚白同异之辩，平原君客之。孔穿自鲁适赵，与公孙龙论臧三耳，龙甚辩析。子高弗应，俄而辞出，明日复见平原君。平原君曰：「畴昔公孙之言信辩也，先生以为何如？」对曰：「然。几能令臧三耳矣。虽然，实难！仆愿得又问于君：今谓三耳甚难而实非也，谓两耳甚易而实是也，不知君将从易而是者乎，其亦从难而非者乎？」平原君无以应。明日，谓公孙龙曰：「公无复与孔子高辩事也！其人理胜于辞；公辞胜于理，终必受诎。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":299,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c8898bd-db0e-11ef-a0c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此亦莊子所謂狗非犬之說。疏云：狗之與犬，一實兩名：名實合，則此爲狗，彼爲犬；名實離，則狗異於犬。又墨子曰：狗，犬也。然殺狗非狗殺犬也。大指與白馬非馬之說同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此亦庄子所谓狗非犬之说。疏云：狗之与犬，一实两名：名实合，则此为狗，彼为犬；名实离，则狗异于犬。又墨子曰：狗，犬也。然杀狗非狗杀犬也。大指与白马非马之说同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c889918-db0e-11ef-bafb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c88991d-db0e-11ef-b7d8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"夫，音扶。別，彼列翻。索隱曰：抒，音墅，抒者舒也；又常恕翻。康曰：亦音舒。","note_content_jianti_auto":"夫，音扶。别，彼列翻。索隐曰：抒，音墅，抒者舒也；又常恕翻。康曰：亦音舒。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8c88991c-db0e-11ef-bcd1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"與，音如字；又讀曰預。","note_content_jianti_auto":"与，音如字；又读曰预。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"8c88991f-db0e-11ef-91b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"辯以求是，辯雖不勝而得審其是，所謂得其所求也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"辩以求是，辩虽不胜而得审其是，所谓得其所求也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"8c889920-db0e-11ef-8ed7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c889924-db0e-11ef-a896-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c889925-db0e-11ef-8d5a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"熊","people_name_jianti_auto":"熊","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c889926-db0e-11ef-a2e8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「紉」作「紛」；乙十一行本同；孔本同；熊校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「纫」作「纷」；乙十一行本同；孔本同；熊校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c889923-db0e-11ef-82d5-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"8c889922-db0e-11ef-8bf6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c889928-db0e-11ef-bc59-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索隱：繳，音糾；康：吉弔切，非。言其言戾，紛然而爭，欲人先屈，務在人後方止也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索隐：缴，音纠；康：吉吊切，非。言其言戾，纷然而争，欲人先屈，务在人后方止也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"8c889927-db0e-11ef-83f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言一座之人皆稱衍言爲善。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言一座之人皆称衍言为善。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":160,"tongjian_id":"8c88992a-db0e-11ef-808b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"通鑑書此，言小辯終不足破大道。絀，音敕律翻。說文曰：絀，貶下也。又讀與屈同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"通鉴书此，言小辩终不足破大道。绌，音敕律翻。说文曰：绌，贬下也。又读与屈同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"8c8abbb1-db0e-11ef-8cd6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"邹衍，战国时代中后期齐国阴阳家的学者，时人称为“谈天衍”。邹衍本是个儒者，齐国稷下学宫成员，创立五德终始说与大地理说，指出朝代兴替受五德转移的支配，将王朝更替理论与宇宙论融合起来；又推想天地之间有大九州，中国只占世界的八十一份之一。邹衍声望甚隆，大受当时诸侯礼遇。邹衍也教人长生不死之术，齐燕方士都祖述其学说。邹衍的政治学说影响了后来的秦朝，秦始皇采用水德，按照五行属水的概念建立制度与仪式。","link_td_id":"Q10002185","link_td_number_id":2199,"people_name":"鄒衍","people_name_jianti_auto":"邹衍","people_xingming":"邹衍","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c8abbb4-db0e-11ef-a06f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"平原君，嬴姓，赵氏，名胜，赵武灵王之子，赵惠文王的弟弟，母不详，是东周战国时期赵国宗室大臣，在赵惠文王和赵孝成王时任宰相，是著名的政治家之一，以善于养士而闻名。和齐国孟尝君田文、魏国信陵君魏无忌、楚国春申君黄歇合称战国四公子。","link_td_id":"Q10005454","link_td_number_id":13307,"people_name":"平原君","people_name_jianti_auto":"平原君","people_xingming":"平原君","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c8abbb6-db0e-11ef-b266-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-320,"link_death_year":-250,"link_td_description":"公孙龙，东周战国时期赵国人（今河北邯郸），传说字子秉，曾经做过平原君的门客，是名家的代表人物，以“白马非马”和“离坚白”等论点而著名。","link_td_id":"Q10000793","link_td_number_id":92102,"people_name":"公孫龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙龙","people_xingming":"公孙龙","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c8abbb7-db0e-11ef-89d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"邹衍，战国时代中后期齐国阴阳家的学者，时人称为“谈天衍”。邹衍本是个儒者，齐国稷下学宫成员，创立五德终始说与大地理说，指出朝代兴替受五德转移的支配，将王朝更替理论与宇宙论融合起来；又推想天地之间有大九州，中国只占世界的八十一份之一。邹衍声望甚隆，大受当时诸侯礼遇。邹衍也教人长生不死之术，齐燕方士都祖述其学说。邹衍的政治学说影响了后来的秦朝，秦始皇采用水德，按照五行属水的概念建立制度与仪式。","link_td_id":"Q10002185","link_td_number_id":2199,"people_name":"鄒子","people_name_jianti_auto":"邹子","people_xingming":"邹衍","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c8abbb8-db0e-11ef-aa67-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"邹衍，战国时代中后期齐国阴阳家的学者，时人称为“谈天衍”。邹衍本是个儒者，齐国稷下学宫成员，创立五德终始说与大地理说，指出朝代兴替受五德转移的支配，将王朝更替理论与宇宙论融合起来；又推想天地之间有大九州，中国只占世界的八十一份之一。邹衍声望甚隆，大受当时诸侯礼遇。邹衍也教人长生不死之术，齐燕方士都祖述其学说。邹衍的政治学说影响了后来的秦朝，秦始皇采用水德，按照五行属水的概念建立制度与仪式。","link_td_id":"Q10002185","link_td_number_id":2199,"people_name":"衍","people_name_jianti_auto":"衍","people_xingming":"邹衍","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"8c8afee9-db0e-11ef-a08d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-320,"link_death_year":-250,"link_td_description":"公孙龙，东周战国时期赵国人（今河北邯郸），传说字子秉，曾经做过平原君的门客，是名家的代表人物，以“白马非马”和“离坚白”等论点而著名。","link_td_id":"Q10000793","link_td_number_id":92102,"people_name":"公孫龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙龙","people_xingming":"公孙龙","start_index":160,"tongjian_id":"8c8afeea-db0e-11ef-b807-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8c889916-db0e-11ef-9bff-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dūn","source_anchor_text":"飾辭以相惇巧譬以相","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":109,"text":"惇","tongjian_id":"e26225ee-78a4-57a3-a28c-99db8422dd8c"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c8abbb5-db0e-11ef-bded-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"鄒衍過趙，平原君使與公孫龍論白馬非馬之說。鄒子曰：「不可。夫辯者，別殊類使不相害，序異端使不相亂。抒意通指，明其所謂，使人與知焉，不務相迷也。故勝者不失其所守，不勝者得其所求。若是，故辯可爲也。及至煩文以相假，飾辭以相惇，巧譬以相移，引人使不得及其意，如此害大道。夫繳紉爭言而競後息，不能無害君子，衍不爲也。」座皆稱善。公孫龍由是遂詘。","content_fanyi":"邹衍路过赵国时，平原君让他与公孙龙辩论“白马非马”的说法。邹衍说：“不可以。辩论是用来区分不同类别，使它们不互相妨害；梳理不同观点，使它们不互相错乱。表达本意，讲明宗旨，说清自己说的是什么，让别人能够知晓，而不在于使人迷惑。所以获胜的人不会丢掉他所坚持的论点，没有获胜的人也能得到他所想寻求的道理。能够这样，辩论才可以进行。至于用繁琐的文辞相互争辩，用修饰的言辞相互推崇，用巧妙的比喻相互转移，把人引到无法触及本意的地方，这样就会损害大道。那种纠缠争辩、抢着发言、以谁最后住口为胜的做法，不能不妨害君子风度，我邹衍是不会做的。”在座的人都称赞说得对。公孙龙从此便不受重视了。","content_jianti_auto":"邹衍过赵，平原君使与公孙龙论白马非马之说。邹子曰：「不可。夫辩者，别殊类使不相害，序异端使不相乱。抒意通指，明其所谓，使人与知焉，不务相迷也。故胜者不失其所守，不胜者得其所求。若是，故辩可为也。及至烦文以相假，饰辞以相惇，巧譬以相移，引人使不得及其意，如此害大道。夫缴纫争言而竞后息，不能无害君子，衍不为也。」座皆称善。公孙龙由是遂诎。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":300,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c889916-db0e-11ef-9bff-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"十七年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"十七年","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c8898a0-db0e-11ef-b10f-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（癸亥、前二九八）","year_int":-298},"message":"success","success":true}